OL,3,AThis is what dying feels like, says
OL,4,Atrain victim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA passenger stabbed multiple times by a
OL,7,Fknifeman accused of trying to kill 10
OL,8,Fpeople on a train has told jurors he
OL,9,Fthought "this is what it feels like to
OL,10,Fdie".
OL,12,FScott Bletcher was on the York to
OL,13,FLondon King's Cross LNER service on 1
OL,14,FNovember last year when the attacks
OL,15,Fhappened, leading to an unscheduled
OL,16,Fstop in Huntingdon, Cambridgeshire.
OL,18,FOn Friday, Cambridge Crown Court also
OL,19,Fheard from staff member Samir Zitouni,
OL,20,Fwho said he fought back using a frying
OL,21,Fpan, stating he did not want to "give
OL,22,Fup until the train stopped".
